{%- comment -%}
  LBASS — HOMEPAGE BRAND PROOF BLOCK (2026-08-05)
  Rendered from snippets/lbass-cro-tracking.liquid, gated to template=='index'.
  NOT from layout/theme.liquid — templates/index.liquid declares {% layout none %}
  so the layout never runs on "/". See snippets/lbass-cro-tracking-hook.liquid.

  ══ WHY THIS EXISTS ══
  Measured 2026-08-05, the homepage was the single weakest page on the site for
  French/English discovery, despite being the highest-authority URL:
      <title>  "Lbass Original | براند أصلي بثمن يناسبك 🇲🇦"  — no French,
               no English, no category noun, no "Maroc"
      <h1>     "قطع أصلية. لوك ما كيتعاودش."  — 100% Arabic script
  And because the layout never runs here, the homepage was also the ONLY page
  on the site with no entity statement at all.

  ══ WHY IT DOES NOT DUPLICATE THE FOOTER ══
  snippets/lbass-entity-block.liquid carries a four-language entity statement
  in the footer of every page that uses the layout. Repeating that paragraph
  here would be padding. So this block is written fresh: the footer states WHAT
  the business is, this states HOW buying works and WHAT you get.

  ══ LANGUAGE HIERARCHY IS THE WHOLE POINT ══
  Darija is typographically dominant — it is the conversion language and this
  must read as a Moroccan shop, not an English shop with Arabic bolted on.
  French and English are present, real and crawlable, but visually secondary
  and correctly marked with lang/dir so screen readers and search engines
  switch pronunciation and tokenisation instead of guessing.

  ══ COLOURS ARE HARDCODED ON PURPOSE — DO NOT "TIDY" THEM INTO var() ══
  snippets/lbass-stamp.liquid loads last and REDEFINES the theme tokens to a
  light palette. Measured live 2026-08-05:
        --cream → #0B0B0C  (black, not cream)
        --ink2  → #F4F2ED  (white, not near-black)
        --gold  → #BF2E15  (red, not gold)
  So `background:var(--ink2)` + `color:var(--cream)` — which reads as
  "dark background, light text" — actually renders light-on-light-ish and the
  design inverts. Every colour below is therefore a literal value. The palette
  chosen (ink band, bone text, red accent) matches the homepage marquee `.mq`,
  which solved the same problem the same way.

  ══ EVERY CLAIM IS CHECKABLE IN ONE CLICK ══
  real photos / condition / 1-of-1 / COD each link to the page that proves it.
  No review counts, no customer numbers, no discounts, no fake stock urgency and
  no certificate claim beyond the internal inspection described honestly on
  /pages/authenticity. Any refund promise must match the published policy.

  ══ LINK TARGETS ARE ALL VERIFIED TO EXIST ══
  The keyword row points at the EXISTING friperie pSEO page rather than a new
  /pages/friperie-en-ligne-maroc. A second friperie page would compete with it
  for the same query — the kind of cannibalisation this project avoids by
  strengthening one useful URL per search intent.
{%- endcomment -%}

